    'SSRF via the Referer header' => 'SSRF melalui header Referer',
    'Some applications use server-side analytics software to track visitors. This software often logs the Referer header in requests, so it can track incoming links. Often the analytics software visits any third-party URLs that appear in the Referer header. This is typically done to analyze the contents of referring sites, including the anchor text that is used in the incoming links. As a result, the Referer header is often a useful attack surface for SSRF vulnerabilities.' => 'Perangkat lunak analitik server kerap mencatat header Referer lalu mengunjungi URL eksternal di dalamnya untuk menganalisis situs perujuk, menjadikan header Referer permukaan serangan SSRF yang potensial.',
